  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "Prolog 生成 R：编译器演示",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "Demonstrates UnifyWeaver compiling Prolog predicates into R code. Part 1: factorial (linear→tail transformation). Part 2: ancestor (transitive closure vs skip/pattern).",
    "kernelLanguage": "python",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 28,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# Prolog 生成 R — UnifyWeaver 编译器演示\n\n本工作簿演示了 **UnifyWeaver** 如何将 Prolog 逻辑编译为可执行的 R 代码 — 实时且直接在笔记本中运行。\n\n## 第 1 部分：阶乘（线性递归）\n1. 加载 UnifyWeaver 编译器环境\n2. 在 Prolog 中定义递归的 `factorial/2`\n3. 编译器检测递归模式并生成等效的 R 循环\n4. 通过 `nb_write/3` 将生成的 R 代码写入另一个单元格\n5. 运行 R 单元格以验证正确性\n\n## 第 2 部分：祖先（传递闭包与模式控制）\n8. 在 Prolog 中定义 `parent/2` 事实和 `ancestor/2` 规则\n9. 使用默认模式编译 → 传递闭包（广度优先图遍历 BFS）\n10. 使用 `skip(transitive_closure)` 重新编译 → 生成不同的代码\n11. 并排比较两种方法",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "## 步骤 1：加载 UnifyWeaver\n\n加载 UnifyWeaver 环境和 R 目标编译器。\n\n**注意：** 在 swipl-wasm 中，请使用 `use_module(unifyweaver(...))`（搜索路径别名），而不是 `use_module(library(...))`。调用 `['../init'].` 会设置 `unifyweaver` 搜索路径，以便正确解析模块。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "['../init'].\n:- use_module(unifyweaver(targets/r_target)).\n:- use_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/linear_recursion)).\n:- use_module(unifyweaver(core/recursive_compiler)).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "load_uw",
        "lastOutput": "Cannot find file: ../init",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Cannot find file: ../init</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "## 步骤 2：在 Prolog 中定义阶乘\n\n一个简单的递归阶乘。基本情况在 N 为 0 时返回 1。递归情况计算 `N * factorial(N-1)`。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": ":- dynamic factorial/2.\n\nfactorial(0, 1).\nfactorial(N, F) :-\n    N > 0,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    factorial(N1, F1),\n    F is N * F1.",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "prolog_factorial",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "## 步骤 3：编译 Prolog → R\n\n编译器执行以下操作：\n1. 通过 `nb_read/3` 从 **prolog_factorial** 单元格读取 Prolog 源码\n2. 进行 consult 将子句插入数据库\n3. 调用 `compile_linear_recursion/3` 检测递归模式，提取步长（`N1 is N - 1` → step=1，递减）并生成 R 的 `for` 循环\n4. 通过 `nb_write/3` 将生成的 R 代码写入 **r_factorial** 单元格\n\n选项 `memo(false)` 请求基于循环的编译，而不是记忆化规约（memoized reduce）。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "%从前一个单元格读取 Prolog 源码\nuser:nb_read('prolog_factorial', '.code', _PrologSrc),\nformat('Read from prolog_factorial:~n~w~n~n', [_PrologSrc]),\n\n%进行 consult 以断言子句\nsetup_call_cleanup(\n    open('/tmp/_nb_src.pl', write, _Out),\n    write(_Out, _PrologSrc),\n    close(_Out)),\nconsult('/tmp/_nb_src.pl'),\n\n%编译 factorial/2 → R\nr_target:init_r_target,\nlinear_recursion:compile_linear_recursion(factorial/2, [target(r), memo(false)], _Code),\nformat('--- Generated R code ---~n~w~n', [_Code]),\n\n%将编译器输出写入 R 单元格\nuser:nb_write('r_factorial', '.code', _Code),\nwriteln('\\nR code written to cell: r_factorial').",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "compile_to_r",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: r_target:init_r_target/0",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: r_target:init_r_target/0</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "## 步骤 4：运行生成的 R 代码\n\n下面的单元格包含编译器生成的 `factorial` 函数。运行它以定义函数，然后运行步骤 5 进行测试。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "# 此单元格将被编译器覆盖。\n# 请先运行上方的 'compile_to_r' 单元格。",
        "type": "code",
