        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "cat(\"6! =\", factorial(6), \"\\n\")\ncat(\"20! =\", factorial(20), \"\\n\")\ncat(\"0! =\", factorial(0), \"\\n\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "test_r",
        "lastOutput": "6! = 720 \n20! = 2.432902e+18 \n0! = 1",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">6! = 720 \n20! = 2.432902e+18 \n0! = 1</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "## 步骤 6：通过 Bash 检查\n\nNotebook VFS 允许任何内核检查单元格。这里 Bash 读取编译器生成的代码：",
        "type": "markdown",
