      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "---\n\n# 第 2 部分：祖先 — 传递闭包与模式控制\n\n同一个编译器也可以处理关系谓词。在这里，我们将 `ancestor/2` 定义为 `parent/2` 事实上的传递闭包。\n\n编译器识别该模式并生成 R 语言的**广度优先搜索 (BFS) 图遍历代码**。但我们也可以传入 `skip(transitive_closure)` 来强制使用不同的编译策略 — 演示 `skip` 和 `pattern` 选项如何控制编译器输出的代码。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "code": "## 步骤 8：在 Prolog 中定义家谱\n\n一个使用 `parent/2` 事实的小型家谱，其中 `ancestor/2` 定义为传递闭包。\n\n注意 Prolog 的简洁性 — `ancestor/2` 只有 2 个子句。所有图遍历逻辑均由编译器自动生成。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "code": ":- dynamic parent/2, ancestor/2.\n\n%家谱\nparent(alice, bob).\nparent(bob, charlie).\nparent(bob, diana).\nparent(charlie, eve).\n\n%传递闭包: 如果 X 是 Y 的祖先，则 ancestor(X, Y)\nancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Y).\nancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Z), ancestor(Z, Y).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "prolog_ancestor",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "code": "## 步骤 9：编译 ancestor/2 → R（默认：传递闭包）\n\n编译器将 `ancestor/2` 分类为 `parent/2` 上的**传递闭包**，并生成包含以下内容的 R 代码：\n- 邻接表（环境哈希表）\n- BFS 遍历函数（`ancestor_all`、`ancestor_check`）\n- 用于填充图的 `add_parent` 函数\n\n这是图中可达性查询的最佳编译方式。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "code": "%进行 consult 加载 ancestor 的定义\nuser:nb_read('prolog_ancestor', '.code', _AncSrc),\nformat('Read from prolog_ancestor:~n~w~n~n', [_AncSrc]),\nsetup_call_cleanup(\n    open('/tmp/_nb_anc.pl', write, _Out),\n    write(_Out, _AncSrc),\n    close(_Out)),\nconsult('/tmp/_nb_anc.pl'),\n\n%使用默认模式检测进行编译 → 传递闭包\nrecursive_compiler:compile_recursive(ancestor/2, [target(r)], _Code1),\nformat('--- Pattern: transitive_closure ---~n~w~n', [_Code1]),\n\n%写入 R 单元格\nuser:nb_write('r_ancestor_tc', '.code', _Code1),\nwriteln('\\nR code written to cell: r_ancestor_tc').",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "compile_ancestor_tc",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: recursive_compiler:compile_recursive/3",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: recursive_compiler:compile_recursive/3</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "code": "## 步骤 10：生成的 R 代码（传递闭包）\n\n此单元格会被编译器用 BFS 图遍历代码覆盖。\n请先运行上面的 `compile_ancestor_tc` 单元格。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "code": "# 此单元格将被编译器覆盖。\n# 请先运行上方的 'compile_ancestor_tc' 单元格。",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "r_ancestor_tc",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "code": "## 步骤 11：查询生成的 R 程序\n\n生成的定义和内嵌的父母事实保留在 R 内核中，因此此单元格将测试这两个可达性 API。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "code": "descendants <- ancestor_all(\"alice\")\ncat(\"alice 的后代:\", paste(descendants, collapse = \", \"), \"\\n\")\ncat(\"alice 是 eve 的祖先:\", ancestor_check(\"alice\", \"eve\"), \"\\n\")\ncat(\"alice 是 frank 的祖先:\", ancestor_check(\"alice\", \"frank\"), \"\\n\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "test_r_ancestor",
        "lastOutput": "Error: could not find function \"ancestor_all\"",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Error: could not find function \"ancestor_all\"</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "code": "## 步骤 12：检查实验性 Bash 回退\n\n现在我们在跳过传递闭包模式的情况下编译**同一个谓词**。编译器回退到其通用的 Bash 尾递归脚手架。\n\n这演示了目标选择机制和跳过选项，但生成的 Bash 包含显式的 TODO，**并不是 ancestor/2 的行为等效实现**。请将其视为编译器开发输出，而非等价程序。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "code": "%再次编译 ancestor/2，但跳过传递闭包 → 回退到尾递归\n%同时以 Bash 为目标展示跨语言编译\nrecursive_compiler:compile_recursive(\n    ancestor/2,\n    [target(bash), skip(transitive_closure)],\n    _Code2),\nformat('--- Pattern: tail_recursion (bash) ---~n~w~n', [_Code2]),\n\n%写入 Bash 单元格\nuser:nb_write('bash_ancestor_alt', '.code', _Code2),\nwriteln('\\nBash code written to cell: bash_ancestor_alt').",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "compile_ancestor_skip",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: recursive_compiler:compile_recursive/3",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: recursive_compiler:compile_recursive/3</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "code": "# 此单元格将被编译器覆盖。\n# 请先运行上方的 'compile_ancestor_skip' 单元格。",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "bash",
        "name": "bash_ancestor_alt",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
